    {"parameters":{"jsCode":"const raw=String($json.data?.modelResponse?.scrapedContent?.text||''); const rx=/\[([^\]]+)\]\((https:\/\/www\.linkedin\.com\/in\/[^\)]+)\)[\s\S]*?\n\n([^\n]+)\n\n([^\n]+(?:, [^\n]+){1,2})/g; const out=[]; let m; while((m=rx.exec(raw))!==null)out.push({json:{name:m[1].trim(),profileUrl:m[2].trim(),headline:m[3].trim(),location:m[4].trim(),eventUrl:$('Limit Events').item.json.event_url}}); return out;"},"type":"n8n-nodes-base.code","typeVersion":2,"position":[2464,96],"id":"parse-attendees","name":"Parse Attendee Profiles"},
